{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんお疲れ様です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46、4期生の林瑠奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日とっても元気です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mob3scmxV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪切りました✂️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やくぼとまつおさんが卒業発表をしましたね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やばーい！😭😭笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しくなると思いますが、みなさんも残り2ヶ月を大事に過ごしましょう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アンダーライブとともに2人の卒業セレモニーも開催されます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切な2人を近くで見送れることが何よりも幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobPxWlu2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい、この頃からずっと一緒にいたね。\n一生マブ👊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobjz2Rfh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "入ってきた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobdTDi2z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イス半分こしたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きょうの一曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「光」/ andymori"}], "source": "official"}